%% AR-05 Sequence: check an address
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant F as Search form
  participant S as Street search
  participant L as Address location
  participant R as Rules engine
  participant V as Result, suggestions, map
  U->>F: Street + number (+ start time, until time)
  F->>S: resolveStreet(name)
  S-->>F: M-zone street, or "not valid here"
  F->>L: locate(street, number)
  L-->>F: position, estimated or exact
  F->>L: side of street, M sections ≤ 45 m
  L-->>R: chosen M section (own side first)
  R->>R: status(start time), nextChange()
  alt until time set
    R->>R: check every 15 min to until time
  end
  R-->>V: verdict, end or start time, reason
  V-->>U: Permit valid? Park now? Until when? Why?
  V->>R: stays for M sections ≤ 500 m
  V-->>U: Longest stays nearby, map with labels
